## AntiPorn (Hisn) - Local Properties Template
# Copy this file to `local.properties` and customize for your development environment.
# `local.properties` is strictly ignored by Git and should never contain production secrets in public repos.

# 1. Android SDK Location (Auto-configured by Android Studio)
sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/Sdk

# 2. Independent OTA Update Distribution (Optional)
# Configure your own Cloudflare R2 public distribution endpoint or S3 bucket URL.
ota.base.url=https://your-r2-bucket.r2.dev
r2.bucket.name=your-releases-bucket

# 3. Release Signing Keystore Password (Optional - only needed for running scripts/publish_new_release.ps1)
# release.keystore.password=YourSecurePassword
